  - title: "Nh\u1EEFng n\u1ED9i dung h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp v\xE0 l\xE0m theo"
    titleVN: "Nh\u1EEFng n\u1ED9i dung h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp v\xE0 l\xE0m theo"
    contentVN: "H\u1ECDc t\u1EADp \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh l\xE0 h\u1ECDc: (1) trung v\u1EDBi n\u01B0\u1EDBc, hi\u1EBFu v\u1EDBi d\xE2n, su\u1ED1t \u0111\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA5u tranh cho c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng, \"th\u1EAFng kh\xF4ng ki\xEAu, b\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng n\u1EA3n\"; (2) c\u1EA7n, ki\u1EC7m, li\xEAm, ch\xEDnh, ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0, khi\xEAm t\u1ED1n, trung th\u1EF1c, tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m; (3) tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, k\xEDnh tr\u1ECDng v\xE0 h\u1EBFt l\xF2ng ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 nh\xE2n d\xE2n, nh\xE2n \xE1i, v\u1ECB tha, khoan dung; (4) \xFD ch\xED v\xE0 ngh\u1ECB l\u1EF1c v\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1ECDi th\u1EED th\xE1ch, gian nguy; (5) ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a y\xEAu n\u01B0\u1EDBc k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p v\u1EDBi ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF v\xF4 s\u1EA3n trong s\xE1ng.\n\nNg\u01B0\u1EDDi d\u1EA1y: vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 l\u1EE3i cho d\xE2n d\xF9 nh\u1ECF c\u0169ng ph\u1EA3i h\u1EBFt s\u1EE9c l\xE0m, vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 h\u1EA1i cho d\xE2n d\xF9 nh\u1ECF c\u0169ng ph\u1EA3i h\u1EBFt s\u1EE9c tr\xE1nh. Trung th\u1EF1c l\xE0 ph\u1EA9m ch\u1EA5t h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u; tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m l\xE0 vi\u1EC7c ph\u1EA3i g\xE1nh v\xE1c, kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 tho\xE1i th\xE1c. Sinh vi\xEAn thi \u0111ua h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp, r\xE8n luy\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EADp nghi\u1EC7p, x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng \u0111\u1EA5t n\u01B0\u1EDBc gi\xE0u m\u1EA1nh, v\u0103n minh. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.259-264)"
    exampleVN: 
    takeawayVN: "N\u0103m n\u1ED9i dung h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp: trung - hi\u1EBFu; c\u1EA7n ki\u1EC7m li\xEAm ch\xEDnh ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0; tin v\xE0 ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 nh\xE2n d\xE2n; \xFD ch\xED ngh\u1ECB l\u1EF1c; y\xEAu n\u01B0\u1EDBc g\u1EAFn qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF."
    content: "H\u1ECDc t\u1EADp \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh l\xE0 h\u1ECDc: (1) trung v\u1EDBi n\u01B0\u1EDBc, hi\u1EBFu v\u1EDBi d\xE2n, su\u1ED1t \u0111\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA5u tranh cho c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng, \"th\u1EAFng kh\xF4ng ki\xEAu, b\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng n\u1EA3n\"; (2) c\u1EA7n, ki\u1EC7m, li\xEAm, ch\xEDnh, ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0, khi\xEAm t\u1ED1n, trung th\u1EF1c, tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m; (3) tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, k\xEDnh tr\u1ECDng v\xE0 h\u1EBFt l\xF2ng ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 nh\xE2n d\xE2n, nh\xE2n \xE1i, v\u1ECB tha, khoan dung; (4) \xFD ch\xED v\xE0 ngh\u1ECB l\u1EF1c v\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1ECDi th\u1EED th\xE1ch, gian nguy; (5) ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a y\xEAu n\u01B0\u1EDBc k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p v\u1EDBi ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF v\xF4 s\u1EA3n trong s\xE1ng.\n\nNg\u01B0\u1EDDi d\u1EA1y: vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 l\u1EE3i cho d\xE2n d\xF9 nh\u1ECF c\u0169ng ph\u1EA3i h\u1EBFt s\u1EE9c l\xE0m, vi\u1EC7c g\xEC c\xF3 h\u1EA1i cho d\xE2n d\xF9 nh\u1ECF c\u0169ng ph\u1EA3i h\u1EBFt s\u1EE9c tr\xE1nh. Trung th\u1EF1c l\xE0 ph\u1EA9m ch\u1EA5t h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u; tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m l\xE0 vi\u1EC7c ph\u1EA3i g\xE1nh v\xE1c, kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 tho\xE1i th\xE1c. Sinh vi\xEAn thi \u0111ua h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp, r\xE8n luy\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EADp nghi\u1EC7p, x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng \u0111\u1EA5t n\u01B0\u1EDBc gi\xE0u m\u1EA1nh, v\u0103n minh. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.259-264)"
