    takeaway: "N\u0103m n\u1ED9i dung h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp: trung - hi\u1EBFu; c\u1EA7n ki\u1EC7m li\xEAm ch\xEDnh ch\xED c\xF4ng v\xF4 t\u01B0; tin v\xE0 ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 nh\xE2n d\xE2n; \xFD ch\xED ngh\u1ECB l\u1EF1c; y\xEAu n\u01B0\u1EDBc g\u1EAFn qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF."
